gs. You're having a large sugar drink, and then you decide to go stretching. Like, no. Go lift subweights. Go to the real gym. Quiet luxury. Like, there's no reason to be quiet. You have money, can I show it? What's the issue? One thing about influencer industry that you just don't like. People giving career, relationship advices, and taking those things as gospel. Single girls who are like, men are like trash. Like, you don't need to be with men. But I'm not going to go ahead and promote that to people. You're very... honest. Do you feel like you have to filter out a lot of things at times? So yeah basically this is like 5% of my personality. If I show any more I will be cancelled.","transcriptLanguage":"en","transcriptChunks":[{"startSeconds":0,"endSeconds":3.36,"text":"This is one of the most expensive things, this is 90,000 dirhams."},{"startSeconds":3.56,"endSeconds":5.76,"text":"I paid 7k for this."},{"startSeconds":5.88,"endSeconds":8.32,"text":"This is Judith Lieber, they don't make this anymore."},{"startSeconds":8.44,"endSeconds":10.08,"text":"25,000 dirhams."},{"startSeconds":10.44,"endSeconds":15.88,"text":"This closet smells, looks, feels like a million bucks."},{"startSeconds":16.32,"endSeconds":18.96,"text":"25,000 dirhams for a cupcake bag."},{"startSeconds":19,"endSeconds":20.08,"text":"What do you fit in this?"},{"startSeconds":23.4,"endSeconds":25.68,"text":"She has over a million people following her."},{"startSeconds":25.72,"endSeconds":28.04,"text":"She's a Dubai kid, a beauty educator,"},{"startSeconds":28.04,"endSeconds":30.88,"text":"award-winning content creator and a founder,"},{"startSeconds":31.08,"endSeconds":32.2,"text":"Hala Oase."},{"startSeconds":34.48,"endSeconds":37.4,"text":"And on this episode, she's taking us into her neighbourhood,"},{"startSeconds":37.56,"endSeconds":40.64,"text":"her home, her closet and even her own restaurant."},{"startSeconds":42.44,"endSeconds":44.24,"text":"This is dog heaven."},{"startSeconds":44.84,"e